				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="300" inout="out" _len="200" _ulen="152" >

INVT_PRD_STA_DYNU^투자기간시작일수^9^0^7^0^0^0^0
INVT_PRD_FIN_DYNU^투자기간종료일수^9^0^7^0^0^0^0
APLY_INRT^적용이율^15^10^7^0^0^0^0
APLY_DATE^적용일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

